### SETUP: Get Admin Token first
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/authenticate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("adminToken", response.body.token);
%}

###

### 1. POST Request (Audit Check: CreatedBy)
# Створюємо нотатку. Поле createdBy має заповнитися автоматично значенням "admin".
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "title": "Audit Test Note",
  "content": "Checking createdBy field from JWT"
}

> {%
  client.global.set("noteId", response.body.id);
%}

###

### 2. PUT Request (Audit Check: LastModifiedBy)
# Оновлюємо ту саму нотатку. Поле lastModifiedBy має оновитися (і дата теж).
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/notes
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "id": "{{noteId}}",
  "title": "Audit Test Note (UPDATED)",
  "content": "Checking lastModifiedBy field from JWT"
}